#: little_tinker_rig/pybricks/firmware.py:482
msgid ""
"EV3 support is experimental and has not been tested on hardware. Use a current "
"Pybricks beta ZIP. Turn EV3 off, hold Right while turning it on, and release Right "
"when Updating appears. Connect one EV3 by USB. LEGO recovery is not provided for EV3."
